.Cm lib
.Xc
Places the libs in the project’s info file on the module path,
so that a bare import finds each by its name.
A
.Ql ":source"
lib is copied to
.Ql "\&.wattle/<name>/" .
A
.Ql ":remote"
lib is fetched into
.Ql "\&.wattle/\&.remote/"
and then placed as the form its own info file declares.
A
.Ql ":native"
lib is built as a native module in
.Ql "zig-out/lib" .
If
.Ar name
is given,
only that lib is placed.
Only this subcommand places libs:
.Ic "wattle run"
does not.
